egin="1:18.164" end="1:24.882" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.164" end="1:19.695">其实你知</span><span begin="1:19.695" end="1:20.609">道</span> <span begin="1:21.095" end="1:22.488">来来往往</span><span begin="1:22.488" end="1:22.829">有</span><span begin="1:22.829" end="1:23.250">多</span><span begin="1:23.250" end="1:23.837">少</span><span begin="1:23.837" end="1:24.882">人</span></p><p begin="1:25.185" end="1:29.057" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.185" end="1:26.753">只是扬起</span><span begin="1:26.753" end="1:27.184">了</span><span begin="1:27.184" end="1:27.623">灰</span><span begin="1:27.623" end="1:29.057">尘</span></p></div><div begin="1:55.973" end="2:16.488" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:55.973" end="2:00.829" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.973" end="1:56.623">明</span><span begin="1:56.623" end="1:57.127">天</span><span begin="1:57.127" end="1:57.630">我</span><span begin="1:57.630" end="1:58.773">就</span><span begin="1:58.773" end="1:59.172">要</span><span begin="1:59.172" end="1:59.754">远</span><span begin="1:59.754" end="2:00.829">走</span></p><p begin="2:01.428" end="2:05.896" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.428" end="2:02.118">最</span><span begin="2:02.118" end="2:02.683">后</span><span begin="2:02.683" end="2:03.315">和</span><span begin="2:03.315" end="2:04.164">你</span><span begin="2:04.164" end="2:05.211">挥挥</span><span begin="2:05.211" end="2:05.896">手</span></p><p begin="2:06.393" end="2:11.664" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.393" end="2:07.139">但你</span><span begin="2:07.139" end="2:07.759">不</span><span begin="2:07.759" end="2:08.197">会</span><span begin="2:08.197" end="2:08.881">哭</span><span begin="2:08.881" end="2:09.860">也</span><span begin="2:09.860" end="2:10.679">不会</span><span begin="2:10.679" end="2:11.032">挽</span><span begin="2:11.032" end="2:11.664">留</span></p><p begin="2:12.677" end="2:16.488" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.677" end="2: